OL,3,GNEWSAImprov community 'devastated' by
OL,4,Atheatre closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city theatre has announced its
OL,7,Fclosure with immediate effect due to
OL,8,Fits "very difficult and precarious
OL,9,Ffinancial position".
OL,11,FThe Bristol Improv Theatre, which was
OL,12,Ffirst established in 2012, has hosted
OL,13,Fnumerous productions, workshops and
OL,14,Fevents, hiring staff, performers,
OL,15,Ffreelancers and volunteers.
OL,17,FIn a statement posted online, the
OL,18,Ftrustees said: "Following a
OL,19,Fprofessional review of the theatre's
OL,20,Ffinances and extensive consideration of
OL,21,Fthe available options, the charity was
OL,22,Fdetermined to be unsustainable."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
