OL,3,GNEWSAImprov community 'devastated' by
OL,4,Atheatre closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreelance improv tutor Tara Judah
OL,7,Fworked at the theatre and told the BBC
OL,8,Fthe news was "devastating" and
OL,9,F"financially upsetting".
